Error [E0073]: this collecting loop path produces no item
  --> tests/ui/yielding_loop_missing_item.jet:2:15
    |
  2 |     values :: loop x in [1, 2] -> {}
    |               ^^^^
 Why: every accepted iteration must contribute one non-unit value unless `next` explicitly omits it
 Fix: return a value on this path, or use `next` to omit the item; remove `->` if the loop only performs effects
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0073
